+<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Simple, honest pricing</div><h1>More connection.<br>Less overhead.</h1><p class="intro">Bring your team together with chat that keeps work moving. Start free, then grow when you’re ready.</p><fieldset class="billing" style="border:0"><legend class="skip">Choose billing frequency</legend><label for="monthly"><input type="radio" name="billing" id="monthly" value="monthly" checked> Monthly</label><label for="yearly"><input type="radio" name="billing" id="yearly" value="yearly"> Yearly</label><span class="save">Save 20%</span></fieldset></div></section>
