+<section class="section" id="compare"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">The details</div><h2>Everything, side by side.</h2><p>Find the right fit for how your team works.</p></div><div class="table-shell" role="region" aria-label="Plan feature comparison" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Feature</th><th scope="col">Free</th><th scope="col">Team</th><th scope="col">Business</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Message history</th><td>90 days</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Team members</th><td>Up to 10</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">File storage</th><td>5 GB total</td><td>10 GB / user</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Integrations</th><td>10</td><td class="yes" aria-label="Unlimited">Unlimited</td><td class="yes" aria-label="Unlimited">Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Audio &amp; video calls</th><td>1:1</td><td>Group calls</td><td>Group calls</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Admin controls &amp; SSO</th><td>—</td><td>Basic</td><td class="yes">✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Priority support</th><td>—</td><td>—</td><td class="yes">✓</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>
+<section class="section faq" id="faq"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Good to know</div><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><p>A few quick answers to help you get started.</p></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><p>Absolutely. The Free plan is free forever, with no credit card required. You can explore Relay with your team and upgrade whenever you need more.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing to save 20% compared with paying month to month. Team is $6.40 per user per month, billed as $76.80 per user each year; Business is $12 per user per month, billed as $144 per user each year.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change or cancel my plan at any time?</summary><p>Yes. You can upgrade, downgrade, or cancel whenever you need. If your needs change, your plan can change with you.</p></details><details><summary>What counts as a user?</summary><p>Each active member of your Relay workspace is one user. Team and Business pricing is per user, per month, with yearly billing discounted by 20%.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer help moving my team to Relay?</summary><p>We’re happy to help. Our team can answer questions about getting started and finding the right plan—reach us at hello@relay.example.</p></details></div></div></section>
